              <h3 class="font-bold text-lg text-slate-900 group-hover:text-red-600 mb-2">Canadian Citizenship Certificate</h3>
              <p class="text-sm text-slate-600">Who needs proof of citizenship after Bill C-3, form CIT 0001, the $75 fee, IRCC's 34-month estimate and e-certificates.</p>
            </div>
          </a>
          <a href="/articles/super-visa-canada" class="block group">
            <div class="h-full bg-white p-6 rounded-2xl border border-slate-100 shadow-sm hover:shadow-lg hover:border-red-100 transition-all">
              <h3 class="font-bold text-lg text-slate-900 group-hover:text-red-600 mb-2">Super Visa for Parents & Grandparents</h3>
              <p class="text-sm text-slate-600">Who qualifies, 5-year stays, the host's minimum income table and 75% option, $100,000 insurance, fees and processing times.</p>
