          </a>
          <a href="/articles/canada-visitor-visa-processing-time" class="block group">
            <div class="h-full bg-white p-6 rounded-2xl border border-slate-100 shadow-sm hover:shadow-lg hover:border-red-100 transition-all">
              <h3 class="font-bold text-lg text-slate-900 group-hover:text-red-600 mb-2">Canada Visitor Visa Processing Time</h3>
              <p class="text-sm text-slate-600">IRCC visitor visa (TRV) processing times by country as of November 2026, fees, IMM 5257 documents and eTA vs visa.</p>
            </div>
          </a>
          <a href="/articles/how-to-become-permanent-resident-canada" class="block group">
            <div class="h-full bg-white p-6 rounded-2xl border border-slate-100 shadow-sm hover:shadow-lg hover:border-red-100 transition-all">
